.SH FILES
.TP
.I
~/.config/fbarcalc/config.toml

.SH EXAMPLES
To run the interactive configuration wizard run with the
.BR config
argument:
.PP
.RS
fbarcalc config
.RE
.PP
Make sure to have your API key ready!
.PP
To also see how the maximum was reached:
.PP
.RS
fbarcalc \-\-verbose
.RE
